{
    "title": "TurboTenant for Renters",
    "description": "*If you\u2019re a landlord, download our \u201cTurboTenant for Landlords'' app to manage your rentals. \r\n\r\nTake your TurboTenant renting experience from your desktop and web browser to a powerful, all-in-one app. \r\n\r\nTurboTenant for Renters makes the entire renting experience easier for the modern renter. It\u2019s the 21st century \u2013 and it\u2019s time the way you rent reflects that. Whether you're paying rent, reporting maintenance issues, tracking your status on a new home, or communicating with your landlord, you can handle it all from the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- Pay Rent From Anywhere: In just a few taps, schedule an upcoming payment or pay your rent on the spot. Also, keep a record of past payments for easy reference. \r\n- Submit Maintenance Requests On the Go: Instantly submit requests as issues arise and keep track of their status in one convenient place. \r\n- Never Miss a Payment: Get reminders for important due dates, so you can stay on top of your finances hassle-free.\r\n- Direct Messaging: Ditch phone tag and cluttered texts! Chat with your landlord directly in the app and keep all your communication organized.",
    "descriptionHTML": "*If you\u2019re a landlord, download our \u201cTurboTenant for Landlords&#39;&#39; app to manage your rentals. <br><br>Take your TurboTenant renting experience from your desktop and web browser to a powerful, all-in-one app. <br><br>TurboTenant for Renters makes the entire renting experience easier for the modern renter. It\u2019s the 21st century \u2013 and it\u2019s time the way you rent reflects that. Whether you&#39;re paying rent, reporting maintenance issues, tracking your status on a new home, or communicating with your landlord, you can handle it all from the palm of your hand.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>- Pay Rent From Anywhere: In just a few taps, schedule an upcoming payment or pay your rent on the spot. Also, keep a record of past payments for easy reference. <br>- Submit Maintenance Requests On the Go: Instantly submit requests as issues arise and keep track of their status in one convenient place. <br>- Never Miss a Payment: Get reminders for important due dates, so you can stay on top of your finances hassle-free.<br>- Direct Messaging: Ditch phone tag and cluttered texts! Chat with your landlord directly in the app and keep all your communication organized.",
